<title>USA: TransMontaigne Q1 shr $0.09 vs $0.14.</title>
<headline>TransMontaigne Q1 shr $0.09 vs $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months</p>
<p>				Ended July 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (000s -- except share, per share data)</p>
<p>								Three Months</p>
<p>							   1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenue					   $194,052     107,691</p>
<p> Net operating margin			     4,082	 3,902</p>
<p> Operating income				   2,236	 2,563</p>
<p> Net earnings					 1,807	 2,031</p>
<p> Net earnings per common share		    .09	   .14</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares	  20,956,139  14,902,347</p>
<p> Net earnings plus depreciation/amortization</p>
<p>  and equity in losses of affiliates	  2,573	 2,332</p>
<p>NOTE: Net operating margin represents revenues less direct operating expenses. Company's full name is TransMontaigne Oil Co.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
